                                "sense_id": "f539ad17-7a38-3274-9809-8bef3abda334",
                                "text": "If there's any direction at the moment, it's to cut costs. This is most clearly visible in services left unrestored since COVID and in current attempts to close almost all of England's ticket offices."
                            }
                        ]
